WEBVTT

00:02.260 --> 00:04.390
And so you escape with your life, boy.

00:05.030 --> 00:09.990
All you're after is the spirit that's
sealed within me!

00:15.510 --> 00:17.810
Want to get married, Rebecca?

00:22.680 --> 00:24.650
You are to be married...

00:27.560 --> 00:29.520
...to Dumas Schkramux.

00:31.790 --> 00:39.530
Bokutachi wa mina kitto te o nobashiterun da

00:39.530 --> 00:46.500
Tooku tooi basho e to

00:59.850 --> 01:06.060
Kaze ni fukare aruite yuku

01:06.060 --> 01:13.020
Umarekita imi o shiritakute

01:13.230 --> 01:19.540
Tatoeba ushinau toki ga kitemo

01:19.540 --> 01:26.670
Dakishimeru koto ima, erabou

01:29.120 --> 01:36.520
Bokutachi wa mina kitto te o nobashiterun da

01:36.520 --> 01:42.500
Nakusenai mono ni mukatte

01:42.500 --> 01:50.140
Kagayaita yume dake o taguriyosenagara

01:50.140 --> 01:57.010
Tooku tooi basho e to

02:04.220 --> 02:07.390
Is something the matter, Princess Rebecca?

02:07.390 --> 02:09.420
You want me...

02:09.420 --> 02:11.360
...to marry this man?

02:11.360 --> 02:14.630
He is a man of great strength,

02:14.630 --> 02:16.970
who rose to the lofty height of
shard champion of Templar.

02:16.970 --> 02:19.760
He is a fitting partner for you.

02:20.800 --> 02:24.210
In Zymot, power is everything.

02:24.210 --> 02:28.340
Those with power can achieve all honors.

02:30.080 --> 02:32.980
When we are eventually pitted against Templar,

02:32.980 --> 02:36.620
this man's strength will surely be of use.

02:36.620 --> 02:39.650
But I don't know anything!

02:39.650 --> 02:42.660
Nothing at all about this man...

02:42.660 --> 02:44.830
The wedding ceremony is tomorrow.

02:44.830 --> 02:48.100
You have plenty of time until then.

02:48.100 --> 02:51.220
That's plenty of time to get to
know this man, Princess.

02:58.870 --> 03:02.870
Episode 12
Progress Towards the Truth

03:04.610 --> 03:07.580
Hey! Are you listening to me?

03:11.290 --> 03:14.090
Where do you think you're taking me?

03:14.090 --> 03:15.720
Hey!

03:16.520 --> 03:19.590
Do you remember?

03:19.590 --> 03:21.890
What Princess Rebecca said?

03:23.300 --> 03:24.900
Amir Gaul?

03:24.900 --> 03:29.100
Yes, that is the name of the spirit you have:
Amir Gaul.

03:29.100 --> 03:31.400
It is one of the rare and valuable spirits.

03:33.210 --> 03:35.010
Amir Gaul...

03:35.480 --> 03:38.270
Yeah, I remember all right.

03:40.150 --> 03:42.620
It may still be too soon for you.

03:43.690 --> 03:46.810
In that case, you should obtain
another sort of power.

03:48.020 --> 03:52.320
It may make you able to control that spirit too.

03:52.830 --> 03:54.450
Really?

03:58.170 --> 04:00.130
Another power?

04:07.380 --> 04:09.910
So beautiful...

04:09.910 --> 04:14.540
The blood of royalty that I so desire
flows through your veins.

04:18.220 --> 04:22.960
Look at this hand, this ugly hand!

04:22.960 --> 04:28.230
Why? Oh why, oh why are you...

04:28.230 --> 04:31.200
are you and I so different?!

04:36.940 --> 04:40.240
You are necessary to me.

04:41.080 --> 04:45.050
I've constantly kept up the whole
noble warrior routine.

04:45.050 --> 04:48.500
I even won myself the title of shard champion!

04:49.520 --> 04:54.290
But did that get me any respect from
those people in Templar?

04:54.290 --> 04:56.490
Oh, no, they were laughing!

04:56.490 --> 04:59.390
They silently sneered at my cursed fate,

04:59.390 --> 05:03.330
at all the time I was so
oppressed and downtrodden!

05:03.330 --> 05:08.370
However, I can be reborn through
my marriage to you!

05:08.370 --> 05:12.830
The glory of nobility will absolve
me of this curse!

05:18.980 --> 05:21.450
Where are you going, Princess Rebecca?

05:22.650 --> 05:25.350
You do not have a choice in the matter.

05:25.350 --> 05:27.120
I believe you already know that.

05:27.120 --> 05:31.790
I did not agree to marry that man!

05:31.790 --> 05:34.260
Then, why did you come back?

05:35.160 --> 05:39.470
Did you think I'd be the one to marry you?

05:39.470 --> 05:40.470
Is that it?

05:40.470 --> 05:41.640
No!

05:41.640 --> 05:43.500
You are my father's enemy!

05:43.500 --> 05:45.110
Why would I ever marry you?!

05:45.110 --> 05:51.910
You returned to this castle,
thinking you were to marry me.

05:51.910 --> 05:53.110
Am I wrong?

05:53.110 --> 05:55.080
You're wrong! Wrong!

05:56.150 --> 05:58.020
Stay away!

05:58.020 --> 05:59.790
I understand...

05:59.790 --> 06:03.590
You only want the spirit inside me.

06:04.030 --> 06:05.630
But it's no use,

06:05.630 --> 06:08.600
I will never give it over to you!

06:10.630 --> 06:12.470
Is that so?

06:12.470 --> 06:15.600
Then, I shall have your father undo the seal.

06:16.300 --> 06:19.440
Wh..What are you talking about?

06:19.440 --> 06:21.810
My father is dead...

06:21.810 --> 06:24.050
You murdered him!

06:24.050 --> 06:29.420
I can't wait to see how the hue
of your fate will change.

06:29.420 --> 06:32.550
What do you mean by saying
such things now?

06:41.930 --> 06:44.170
That is my princess.

06:44.170 --> 06:46.130
I will carry her.

06:53.040 --> 06:56.670
I never had any interest in her
heart or mind anyway.

07:01.920 --> 07:05.990
What's going to happen to us, Master Robès?

07:05.990 --> 07:09.620
Well, at this rate we'll no doubt be executed.

07:09.960 --> 07:12.590
What? No!

07:12.590 --> 07:13.730
I don't want that.

07:13.730 --> 07:15.530
I don't want to die like this!

07:17.270 --> 07:21.040
Sorry, it seems I took the joke a bit too far.

07:21.040 --> 07:24.040
I am certain you'll be seeing Zed.

07:24.040 --> 07:28.000
You followed me because you were
worried about him, right?

07:29.440 --> 07:31.610
Wh..Why would I be worried about that moron?!

07:31.610 --> 07:35.320
"Love" is something that blossoms
before you even know it.

07:35.320 --> 07:36.320
Love?!

07:36.320 --> 07:38.050
It's not like that at all!

07:38.050 --> 07:41.720
Now, now, don't be so flustered.

07:41.720 --> 07:45.680
I shall keep a caring eye on you two
and your future together.

07:46.060 --> 07:47.860
Good grief!

07:48.560 --> 07:51.360
Zed, you moron, where are you?

08:00.740 --> 08:02.710
Hey, aren't we there yet?

08:06.380 --> 08:09.350
Sheesh, she's taking the strong and
silent act far enough.

08:16.690 --> 08:18.660
What the hell is this place?

08:27.100 --> 08:29.070
There is an old tale...

08:30.400 --> 08:32.670
The master that dwells in this spring

08:32.670 --> 08:36.740
is possessed of a soul of abundant
power, so it is said.

08:36.740 --> 08:40.580
Many a soldier has sought to obtain this power

08:40.580 --> 08:44.090
by challenging the master of the spring,

08:44.090 --> 08:47.920
but not one has ever returned.

08:47.920 --> 08:49.550
Zed!

08:50.960 --> 08:55.330
As you are now, you will surely
have need of this power.

08:55.330 --> 08:57.960
You will decide the outcome.

09:01.870 --> 09:03.700
Where do you think you're going?

09:03.700 --> 09:06.070
To Princess Rebecca.

09:06.070 --> 09:10.030
I have not seen her smile in quite a long time.

09:11.510 --> 09:13.480
I must bring that back.

09:15.020 --> 09:16.780
I'll catch up with you for sure!

09:16.780 --> 09:18.190
After I get this power.

09:18.190 --> 09:19.980
I promise!

09:35.240 --> 09:37.410
What happened to Despara?

09:37.410 --> 09:39.370
She went back to Tusk a little earlier.

09:39.370 --> 09:41.740
She said to give you her regards.

09:41.740 --> 09:43.310
That's good.

09:43.310 --> 09:47.350
We do need to maintain a friendly
relationship with Tusk after all.

09:47.350 --> 09:50.180
Who gives a crap about that?!

09:50.180 --> 09:54.260
More importantly, are you really
going to have this wedding?

09:54.260 --> 09:55.490
Well, are you?

09:55.490 --> 09:59.160
It will serve to comfort the lonely princess.

09:59.160 --> 10:02.730
Besides, Dumas can still be of use to us.

10:02.730 --> 10:04.770
An outsider like him?

10:04.770 --> 10:09.900
The rebels will all be here to partake
of the wedding festivities.

10:10.570 --> 10:13.200
The best way to kill rats is to round
them up in one place first.

10:14.480 --> 10:15.540
Got it?

10:15.540 --> 10:17.510
You should've just said so!

10:27.690 --> 10:29.490
What the hell?

10:34.930 --> 10:37.560
Are you the master of the spring?

10:51.980 --> 10:53.780
It's so hard!

11:13.130 --> 11:17.760
Those who seek power will
eventually be overcome by it.

11:33.920 --> 11:35.360
Who is that?

11:35.360 --> 11:38.480
Is that the one with the "great power"?

11:53.870 --> 11:56.340
Is this thing protecting him?

12:06.220 --> 12:10.180
Wrong, this monster isn't protecting him at all!

12:10.560 --> 12:12.530
It's got him trapped in there!

12:19.370 --> 12:24.330
It's been decided that tomorrow I will
carry out your executions myself.

12:26.370 --> 12:29.210
As part of the entertainment for
the wedding ceremony.

12:29.210 --> 12:34.320
It will symbolize my final farewell to Templar.

12:34.320 --> 12:41.220
I will wed Rebecca and be accepted as royalty.

12:41.220 --> 12:42.460
What are you talking about?

12:42.460 --> 12:46.090
What about Mickey? He always had faith in you!

12:47.660 --> 12:49.790
Mickey?

12:52.570 --> 12:54.700
I'm going to become royalty!

12:54.700 --> 12:58.660
You think I care about how that little idiot feels?!

13:18.260 --> 13:22.060
Then, I shall have your father undo the seal.

13:22.060 --> 13:27.190
I can't wait to see how the hue
of your fate will change.

13:31.940 --> 13:33.970
I don't understand...

13:33.970 --> 13:37.600
I don't understand anything anymore.

13:41.080 --> 13:42.820
Tomorrow's the day, huh?

13:42.820 --> 13:48.660
Once Princess Rebecca's wedding is over,
a little happiness will finally come our way.

13:48.660 --> 13:55.030
Yeah, since Rebecca will certainly be
at the top of the new government.

13:55.030 --> 13:58.160
Guess our struggle was worthwhile, huh?

13:59.930 --> 14:01.040
Reward?

14:01.040 --> 14:03.040
Please don't act like you don't know!

14:03.040 --> 14:06.840
I'm the one who made Princess Rebecca
agree to the marriage!

14:06.840 --> 14:10.300
I'm the one who brought the rebels into line!

14:11.350 --> 14:15.750
Ah, yes, your efforts were excellent indeed.

14:15.750 --> 14:18.220
Once the wedding ceremony is over,

14:18.220 --> 14:23.180
I will appoint you commander-in-chief
of the regular army.

14:26.830 --> 14:29.430
How I've waited for this!

14:29.430 --> 14:32.400
So long... I've waited for so long!

14:38.570 --> 14:40.870
I'm amazed a person could change so much.

14:42.810 --> 14:44.610
No kidding.

14:45.950 --> 14:47.740
Princess Rebecca!

14:48.450 --> 14:49.780
Who are you?

14:49.780 --> 14:52.520
You're one of Rebecca's comrades?

14:52.520 --> 14:54.320
Do you know where she is?

14:54.320 --> 14:56.720
Please, let us out of here!

14:56.720 --> 14:58.690
I'll help you out!

15:05.370 --> 15:10.140
If you desire power, the desire
will beget greater want.

15:10.140 --> 15:15.540
Many have vanished into this spring,
overwhelmed by that want.

15:15.540 --> 15:21.480
The master uses this want to lure in
and kill those who seek power,

15:21.480 --> 15:24.110
and it binds them to itself through this want.

15:29.420 --> 15:35.560
Your soul, too, will be bound
eternally to this spring.

15:35.960 --> 15:37.760
Give me a break!

15:39.230 --> 15:41.940
Now that I've heard your story,
it turns out it's no big deal!

15:41.940 --> 15:46.570
You just turned out this way because
your "want" is too small!

15:53.380 --> 15:54.420
Thank you!

15:54.420 --> 15:56.120
C'mon, let's go.

15:56.120 --> 15:58.240
I'm going to stay here.

16:00.020 --> 16:03.650
I'd really like to fight Dumas.

16:05.930 --> 16:07.720
Master Robès...

16:12.430 --> 16:14.060
Phillip?

16:18.910 --> 16:21.580
Phillip, what is that sword?

16:21.580 --> 16:26.680
It is a symbol of the commander-in-chief
of the Zymotan regular army!

16:26.680 --> 16:30.650
From today forth, you will all
be working under me!

16:30.650 --> 16:32.420
Wh..What?!

16:32.420 --> 16:33.550
Get out of here!

16:33.550 --> 16:35.260
Why are you the only one?

16:35.260 --> 16:38.330
You had us fooled right from the start!

16:38.330 --> 16:40.660
Do you mean to say you betrayed
Princess Rebecca?!

16:40.660 --> 16:42.060
Give me that!

16:42.060 --> 16:43.760
What are you doing?!

16:43.760 --> 16:44.400
Shut up!

16:44.400 --> 16:45.870
Just give it to me!
Shut up!

16:52.740 --> 16:55.240
Why do you seek power?

16:55.240 --> 16:57.870
What's wrong with seeking power?!

17:05.050 --> 17:10.510
Don't you find people who are
driven by desire to be ugly?

17:11.260 --> 17:13.490
Give it to me!

17:13.490 --> 17:15.200
Stay the hell back!

17:15.200 --> 17:17.490
This sword is mine!

17:18.300 --> 17:23.100
There's no way in hell I'll give you the
position I've worked so hard for!

17:24.170 --> 17:26.140
Phillip!

17:29.740 --> 17:31.680
Phillip, you...

17:31.680 --> 17:34.480
Looks like you guys are all set to take
each other out on your own.

17:36.880 --> 17:38.850
But I can't have that.

17:39.550 --> 17:41.520
Wouldn't be very interesting.

17:43.620 --> 17:44.630
It's no use.

17:44.630 --> 17:46.590
There's no escape for you.

17:54.270 --> 17:55.300
St..Stop...

17:55.300 --> 17:56.370
Get back!

17:56.370 --> 18:00.940
I'm the commander-in-chief of the regular army!

18:00.940 --> 18:02.940
Lucky you!

18:02.940 --> 18:04.910
You got to dream a nice little dream.

18:15.060 --> 18:16.120
Princess Rebecca!

18:16.120 --> 18:17.620
Elda!

18:17.620 --> 18:20.750
Thank goodness you're still alive!

18:21.400 --> 18:24.850
Your highness... Likewise, Princess,
I am glad you're safe.

18:26.400 --> 18:28.170
Leave that for later!

18:28.170 --> 18:29.970
You're Roya?

18:29.970 --> 18:31.340
Just come quickly!

18:31.340 --> 18:33.310
Let's get out of here!

18:35.640 --> 18:37.440
What is it?

18:39.180 --> 18:44.220
If I run away, it would betray my
comrades in the Resistance.

18:44.220 --> 18:45.890
They've been loyal to me for a long time...

18:45.890 --> 18:47.680
Princess Rebecca!

18:48.660 --> 18:54.060
There's not a single person in the Resistance
who cares about you, yourself!

18:54.060 --> 18:56.530
You must know this too.

18:58.170 --> 19:00.530
Elda...

19:00.530 --> 19:02.700
You don't have time to hesitate!

19:02.700 --> 19:05.170
Come on, hurry up! Hurry!

19:06.540 --> 19:10.210
The wish to obtain power greater than others...

19:10.210 --> 19:14.150
It is this ugly desire that makes people suffer.

19:14.150 --> 19:17.780
It kills them; it ruins them!

19:18.350 --> 19:20.650
I don't think so.

19:21.720 --> 19:25.180
We can move forward because
we have desires.

19:26.060 --> 19:28.360
Without ever giving up...

19:29.700 --> 19:31.990
That's right, I don't think desire is ugly at all.

19:32.400 --> 19:36.030
What you call desire I call hope!

19:40.110 --> 19:42.840
You didn't have any great hopes.

19:42.840 --> 19:47.300
That's why you were overcome
by your lame-ass desire!

20:03.430 --> 20:06.060
Use that sword.

20:26.920 --> 20:33.220
That is what you seek, a soul
of abundant power.

20:40.370 --> 20:41.990
Old man!

20:50.510 --> 20:54.470
This is a "soul of abundant power"?

20:56.220 --> 21:01.680
It appears that fate has correctly chosen
the new holder of this power.

21:17.240 --> 21:19.370
The difference between right and
wrong may be something

21:19.370 --> 21:24.310
that can only be discerned after
people have perished.

21:24.310 --> 21:30.270
I never dreamed I would be able to see
the sky before departing this place.

21:31.850 --> 21:33.390
Boy...

21:33.390 --> 21:37.520
See to it that you fulfill that hope.

21:41.430 --> 21:46.170
This spirit, Rambos, is yours now.

21:46.170 --> 21:49.800
Take it with you, and the sword as well!

21:56.440 --> 21:58.240
Thank you.

21:59.950 --> 22:01.380
Let's go.

22:01.380 --> 22:03.180
Time for payback.

22:50.400 --> 22:54.270
Kimi no sono kokoro no naka o nozoite
shiritai sono kimochi to hyoujou

22:54.270 --> 22:58.170
Hitori seotta kimi no sugata kirari
hikaru namida no wake wa

22:58.170 --> 23:01.740
Kikazu ni iwazu ni okuru yo eeru
sagashiteru kotae no aida ni

23:01.740 --> 23:05.870
Kodawarisugizu kangaesugizu asu
no kimi ni komorebi kanjiru

23:07.580 --> 23:09.420
Very very much de ii kanji

23:09.420 --> 23:11.220
Very very good kimi to boku

23:11.220 --> 23:15.090
ltsudemo kimi no soba ni ite
agetai to omotterun da

23:15.090 --> 23:16.920
Very very much itsudatte

23:16.920 --> 23:18.760
Very very good kawaranai

23:18.760 --> 23:24.720
Bokura wa itsumo kibou de
chikarazuyoku saiterun da (Oh)

23:30.240 --> 23:32.710
Mayoi no naka kono yasashisa kanji

23:34.010 --> 23:36.480
Donna toki mo kimi o zutto shinji

23:37.740 --> 23:41.650
Koko ni ookiku hirogaru keshiki
buruusukai no hi no shita de

23:41.650 --> 23:45.780
li kibun ii mibun ii jibun zutto koko ni itai kibun

23:47.250 --> 23:49.060
Very very much de ii kanji

23:49.060 --> 23:50.890
Very very good kimi to boku

23:50.890 --> 23:54.690
ltsudemo kimi no soba ni ite
agetai toomotterun da

23:54.690 --> 23:56.560
Very very much itsudatte

23:56.560 --> 23:58.430
Very very good kawaranai

23:58.430 --> 24:04.390
Bokura wa itsumo kibou de
chikarazuyoku saiterun da (Oh)

24:16.350 --> 24:19.940
Next Time
Hurtling Power

24:16.880 --> 24:19.940


